MODIFICATIONS FROM PREVIOUS VERSION:

Game now works as a simple state machine
It uses a state variable to store what 'mode' the program is in.
States are:
0 - Menu
1 - Memory Game
2 - Math Game
3 - Game Over

Game flow is now:
Menu Screen -> Press button 1/2 to select game -> Memory or Math game -> Game returns score -> Game Over Screen -> returns to Menu Screen

Math game logic not written yet, but code is prepped to include it.
